build/*/c_js/witness_calculator.js, generate_witness.js
  Generated by circom 2.2.3; distributed under GPL-3.0 (LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt).

contracts/PostVerifier.sol
  Groth16 verifier generated by snarkjs 0.7.5 from build/vcrln_d20/c.zkey; GPL-3.0 (see its header and
  LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt).

contracts/EthereumDIDRegistry.sol
  The ERC-1056 reference registry from https://github.com/uport-project/ethr-did-registry
  (contracts/EthereumDIDRegistry.sol, identical to the upstream file). The file carries an SPDX MIT header; the
  upstream repository is licensed Apache-2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). It is kept as compiled and deployed for the
  measurements.

circuits/baseline/rln.circom, circuits/baseline/utils.circom
  The reference RLN v2 circuit from https://github.com/Rate-Limiting-Nullifier/circom-rln, commit
  17f0fed7d8d19e8b127fd0b3e5295a4831193a0d, dual-licensed Apache-2.0 / MIT (circuits/baseline/LICENSE-MIT).
