vc_check/vc_contexts/*.json
  JSON-LD contexts of the W3C Verifiable Credentials and DID specifications
  (https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2, https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/undefined-terms/v2,
  https://www.w3.org/ns/did/v1, https://w3id.org/security/multikey/v1, https://w3id.org/security/data-integrity/v2),
  cached so that the check runs offline apart from DID resolution; W3C Software and Document License
  (LICENSES/W3C-2023.txt; https://www.w3.org/copyright/software-license-2023/).
  The per-context source URLs, copyright notices and unchanged-file hashes are recorded in
  LICENSES/W3C-CONTEXTS-NOTICE.txt.
